                    <element name="hl7:originalText" minimumMultiplicity="0" maximumMultiplicity="1" conformance="R" id="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.9.203">
                        <desc language="en-US">
                            <p>The &lt;originalText&gt; element within the &lt;code&gt; element described above is used as follows: the &lt;value&gt; contains a &lt;reference&gt; to the &lt;originalText&gt; in order to link the coded value to the problem narrative text (minus any dates, comments, et cetera). The &lt;reference&gt; contains a URI in value attribute. This URI points to the free text description of the problem in the document that is being described. </p>
